@startuml
title RepFuel - Tenant Admin Configures Tenant Account Activity Diagram


|Tenant Admin|
:Open RepFuel app;
:Log in;
:Go to Tenant Settings page;

|Frontend / PWA|
:Request tenant settings;
:Send request to Auth / Tenant Service;

|Auth / Tenant Service|
:Validate authentication token;
:Check user role;

if (User is TENANT_ADMIN?) then (Yes)
  :Fetch tenant account;
  :Fetch tenant settings;
else (No)
  |Frontend / PWA|
  :Show unauthorized access error;
  stop
endif

|Frontend / PWA|
:Display tenant settings form;

|Tenant Admin|
:Update tenant account details;

note right
Tenant name
Tenant slug
Default post visibility
Public discovery setting
Comment settings
Profile branding
end note

:Submit updated settings;

|Frontend / PWA|
:Validate form fields;

if (Form data valid?) then (Yes)
  :Send update request to Auth / Tenant Service;
else (No)
  :Show validation errors;
  stop
endif

|Auth / Tenant Service|
:Validate authentication token;
:Confirm user is tenant admin;
:Validate tenant ownership;
:Check slug availability;

if (Tenant update allowed?) then (Yes)
  :Update tenant record;
  :Update tenant settings record;
else (No)
  |Frontend / PWA|
  :Show tenant update error;
  stop
endif

|Auth / Tenant Service|
:Return updated tenant settings;

|Frontend / PWA|
:Refresh tenant settings page;
:Show success message;

|Tenant Admin|
:Tenant account configured successfully;

stop

@enduml